- `FINAL_BALLOT: voter=data-platform-engineer; choice=B; state=EXPERIMENT; conditions=persistent disk confirmed for a single instance, else choose C; engines bump or driver approved by owner; write path and repository interface defined with orgId required; header authentication fixed before tenant data is stored; restart-loss reproduction run as the first test`
